WEBVTT

00:21.320 --> 00:22.720
Sheng'er.

00:24.920 --> 00:26.320
You've grown up.

00:31.520 --> 00:32.920
Father.

00:33.720 --> 00:38.680
Your son truly had no choice for all under heaven for the people's peace.

00:39.280 --> 00:41.280
Your son had no other way.

00:42.920 --> 00:48.600
The 22nd year of Longwu Sikong Yao announced his abdication the crown prince ascended the throne.

00:48.680 --> 00:51.160
Honored Sikong Yao as Retired Emperor.

00:54.000 --> 01:10.000
The following year, the southern territories of Xuan were breached and Great Xuan collapsed. Retired Emperor Sikong Yao was taken captive and escorted to the Wu Jun capital, forced to pour wine in servant's robes. Ultimately unable to endure such humiliation, he hanged himself.

01:10.080 --> 01:12.580
The Chen clan secretly subsidized enemy forces. Supplies were set ablaze en route, forcing the Northern Expedition to retreat in bitter regret once more.

